digital_control.description:
Enter a command join to test. Object 0 means top-level CIP. A button sends a 150 ms press/release; a switch holds the digital value until turned off. Scene and source selections usually need a button. Saving sends no commands. Serial name numbers do NOT establish digital command numbers. Switch state shows received digital feedback only and does not prove equipment power.

